Usage: semaphore-cli generate manifest --flag_manifest_destination=STRING [flags]

📄 (experimental) Generate an OpenFeature flag manifest based on your flags
configuration.

📄 (experimental) Generate an OpenFeature flag manifest based on your flags
configuration. ⚠️ note that this is an experimental feature and we may change
this command line without warning.

Flags:
  -h, --help             Show context-sensitive help.
  -v, --version          Print the version and exit

  -f, --format="yaml"    Format of your input file (YAML, JSON or TOML)
  -c, --config=STRING    Location of your Semaphore local configuration file
      --flag_manifest_destination=STRING
                         Destination of your flag manifest file. If not
                         provided, the manifest will be printed to the console.
